    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703460/extras/8754076068ca954d6967d700c866ed51.avif?t=1752234668\" width=800 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match X's and O's in classic style on ever-increasing board sizes. force stalemates to level up and increase score multipliers, increasing the challenge while you try not to lose. This simple tic-tac-toe inspired game is surprisingly strategic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to Learn, Easy to Get In Too Deep</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early moves are key to higher scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put off winning to increase your score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternate game modes to mix up your strategy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703460/extras/856c7e09d6b1bd5ecf8916109b37e67c.avif?t=1752234668\" width=800 height=299 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703460/extras/8754076068ca954d6967d700c866ed51.avif?t=1752234668\" width=800 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match X's and O's in classic style on ever-increasing board sizes. force stalemates to level up and increase score multipliers, increasing the challenge while you try not to lose. This simple tic-tac-toe inspired game is surprisingly strategic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to Learn, Easy to Get In Too Deep</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early moves are key to higher scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put off winning to increase your score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternate game modes to mix up your strategy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703460/extras/856c7e09d6b1bd5ecf8916109b37e67c.avif?t=1752234668\" width=800 height=299 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Inspired by the idea of breaking free from endless stalemates, TicTacTix redefines the classic game of tic-tac-toe. It evolves the simple mechanics into a battle of strategy, where decisive moves replace deadlock, and every play counts.",
